<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman starts 12 financial cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman starts 12 financial cos.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said analyst Thomas Facciola started coverage of 12 financial companies.</p>
<p>-- Started Associates First Capital Inc, Capital One Financial Corp, Dean Witter Discover &amp; Co Inc, Green Tree Financial Corp and MBNA Corp with outperform ratings.  </p>
<p>-- Started American Express Co, Beneficial Corp, Household International Inc, Money Store Inc, United Cos Financial Corp and Union Acceptance Corp with neutral ratings.  </p>
<p>-- Started First Merchants Acceptance Corp with an underperform rating.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
